Wrong (B): Using only the statutory federal rate ignores state taxes, permanent differences, and credits that affect the effective rate.
Wrong (D): The actual rate through the interim date does not incorporate the full-year estimate required by ASC 740-270.$EXPL$
WHERE id = 4888;

